      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "UTAH GUNN (1) has a terrific record this track and trip with four wins and one placing from five starts. Was out of the placings last time (25.86) at Q Lakeside in a Grade 5, finishing sixth and beaten 6 lengths. With a clean break looks hard to beat. HOOKED ON MAGIC (2) turned spotting a big start finishing fifth (19.13) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Form from his last run is proving strong. Key player if finds best. UNDENIABLE GRIT (7) settled midfield in the run and boxed on to finish there when 5th (20.17) at Capalaba. Form here at the trip sound including two wins. Warrants plenty of respect. TUTA MOMENT (8) hit the frame here last start and can sneak into the finish again.",
